  "summary": "无限满二叉树各层编号连续但方向交替，给定 label，返回根到该节点的编号路径。",
  "insight": "当前层编号范围 [start,end] 中，之字形 label 的镜像正常编号是 start+end-label；其父节点编号再除二，即可逐层向上。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "层号从零开始",
    "每次求父前使用当前层范围",
    "自底向上收集后要反转"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "level-mirror-parent-walk",
      "title": "层内镜像父节点回溯",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用每层首尾和把之字编号映射到父层。",
      "steps": [
        "从 label 所在 level=floor(log2(label)) 开始",
        "while label>=1：加入 label，start=2^level,end=2^(level+1)-1",
        "label=(start+end-label)/2，level--；最后反转路径"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(log label)",
        "space": "O(log label)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/level-mirror-parent-walk/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/level-mirror-parent-walk/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/level-mirror-parent-walk/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
